        "content": "# Module 19: GOVERNMENT SCHEMES, STUDENT GRANTS AUR SUBSIDIES\n\nAiyyo mere pyaare dost! Welcome to **Module 19 of Rupaiya 101**! \n\nAgar aapne ab tak ke saare modules padhe hain, toh aapko already pata hai ki budgeting kaise karte hain (Module 2), emergency fund kaise banate hain (Module 4), debt trap se kaise bachte hain (Module 5), stock market aur mutual funds mein kaise invest karte hain (Module 7), aur taxes kaise bachate hain (Module 10 & 13). ",
