        "totalCardsInTopic": 3,
        "title": "Overview (Part 2)",
        "content": "Lekin kya aapko pata hai ki India mein har saal **hazaaron crore rupaye** ke government subsidies, student grants, interest waivers, zero-collateral business loans, aur stipend schemes un-claimed hoke pade rehte hain — sirf isliye kyunki 90% college students ko inka pata hi nahi hota?\n\nAksar students sochte hain:\n- *\"Bhai, education loan liya hai toh bank ko poora interest dena hi padega.\"* (**WRONG!** Central government aapka 100% interest maaf kar sakti hai moratorium period ke dauran!)\n- *\"Scholarship toh sirf 95%+ marks walo ko milti hai.\"* (**WRONG!** Thousands of government grants girls, single child, disabled, aur specific skill courses ke liye reserved hain!)\n- *\"Student life mein business start karne ke liye ghar bechna padega ya property mortgage karni padegi.\"* (**WRONG!** Govt ki MUDRA scheme se aap bina kisi collateral (property/guarantor) ke ₹50,000 se ₹10 Lakh tak ka loan le sakte ho!)\n- *\"Scholarship ya fellowship ke paise par Bada Tax lagega.\"* (**WRONG!** Section 10(16) ke andar education grants 100% Tax-Free hote hain!)\n\nIs module mein hum Bharat Sarkar (Central Govt) aur State Governments ki sabse powerful financial schemes ka deep post-mortem karenge. High school se leke PhD research, aur campus startup se leke top 500 corporate internships tak — har stage ke liye paise kaise extract karne hain, uska exact step-by-step blueprint yahan milega.",
