        "topicTitle": "Business & Entrepreneurship Schemes for Young Youth",
        "cardIndex": 1,
        "totalCardsInTopic": 3,
        "title": "Business & Entrepreneurship Schemes for Young Youth",
        "content": "Aaj ka student sirf \"job seeker\" nahi rehna chahta, woh \"job creator\" banna chahta hai! Campus mein mobile repair shop, xerox printing hub, cloud kitchen, SaaS startup, drop-shipping hub, ya drone repair workshop kholna chahte ho? \n\nPar sabse bada roadblock kya hai? **Seed Capital (Paisa)!** Banks normal 20-year-old student ko bina collateral ke loan nahi dete.\n\nLekin Bharat Sarkar ki teen flagship schemes — **PMMY (MUDRA)**, **PMEGP**, aur **Stand-Up India** — students ke is problem ko hamesha ke liye solve karti hain.\n\n---\n\n### 19.3.1 Pradhan Mantri MUDRA Yojana (PMMY) — Zero Collateral Campus Business Loans\n\n**MUDRA (Micro Units Development & Refinance Agency)** scheme specifically micro-entrepreneurs aur young youth ke liye design ki gayi hai. Is scheme ki sabse khoobsurat baat: **NO PHYSICAL COLLATERAL & NO THIRD-PARTY GUARANTOR NEEDED!**\n\nGovernment ka **CGFMU (Credit Guarantee Fund for Micro Units)** fund banks ko default guarantee cover provide karta hai.\n\n#### The 3 Tiers of MUDRA Loans (Table 19.9)\n\n| MUDRA Tier Category | Sanctioned Loan Limit | Ideal Student Business Use Case | Bank Processing Fee | Interest Rate Range | Repayment Tenure |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **SHISHU** | **Up to ₹50,000** | Campus Printing/Xerox counter, Event Decor kit, Podcasting Gear setup, Micro E-commerce initial stock. | **NIL (0%)** | 8.50% - 10.00% p.a. | Up to 5 Years |\n| **KISHOR** | **Above ₹50,000 to ₹5,00,000** | Campus Cyber Cafe, Custom T-Shirt Printing Studio, Photography/Videography Studio, Mobile Repair Shop, Bakery/Cloud Kitchen. | **0.50% max** or Nil | 9.00% - 11.50% p.a. | 3 to 5 Years |\n| **TARUN** | **Above ₹5,00,000 to ₹10,00,000** | Tech Hardware Repair & Assembly unit, EV Charging Station setup, Drone Repair Hub, Small Garment Manufacturing unit. | **0.50% max** | 10.00% - 12.00% p.a. | Up to 7 Years |\n\n*(Note: Under updated MUDRA guidelines, a new **Tarun Plus** tier of up to ₹20 Lakhs is available for entrepreneurs who have successfully repaid previous Tarun loans).*\n\n#### The MUDRA Card Mechanism:\nJab aap Kishor ya Tarun loan lete ho, toh bank aapko poora loan cash mein nahi deta. Loan ka ek portion Equipment Term Loan hota hai, aur remaining portion **Working Capital Overdraft** ke roop mein ek **MUDRA Card** (RuPay Debit Card) par load kar diya jaata hai. \n\nAap paper reams, ink cartridges, ya inventory khareedne ke liye MUDRA Card swipe kar sakte ho. Interest ONLY us amount par chalega jitna aapne draw kiya hai!\n\n```\n[Student Business Plan] ──(Apply via JanSamarth Portal)──> [Partner Commercial Bank]\n                                                                  │\n                                                    (Zero Collateral Verification)\n                                                                  │\n                                                                  ▼\n [MUDRA Kishor Sanction] ───> [Equipment Term Loan (75%)] + [MUDRA RuPay Overdraft Card (25%)]\n```\n\n---\n\n### 19.3.2 PMEGP (Prime Minister's Employment Generation Programme) — Up to 35% Cash Subsidy!\n\nAgar aapka business plan bada hai (e.g., small manufacturing unit, recycling plant, food processing factory, or large-scale IT service center), toh MUDRA se bhi zyaada powerful scheme hai **PMEGP**, administered by KVIC (Khadi and Village Industries Commission).\n\nPMEGP is a **Credit-Linked Subsidy Scheme**. Meaning: Government aapke total project cost par **15% se 35% tak Direct Cash Subsidy (Margin Money)** deti hai!\n\n#### Maximum Project Cost Caps under PMEGP:\n- **Manufacturing Sector Projects:** Maximum up to **₹50.00 Lakhs**\n- **Service / Business Sector Projects:** Maximum up to **₹20.00 Lakhs**",
        "color": "#2563eb",
        "emoji": "🏛️",
        "interactiveType": "none"
